# Requests de teste manual (VS Code REST Client / IntelliJ HTTP Client).
# Suba a aplicação com `mvn spring-boot:run` e execute cada bloco com "Send Request".

@baseUrl = http://localhost:8080

### Health check
GET {{baseUrl}}/actuator/health

### OpenAPI (JSON)
GET {{baseUrl}}/v3/api-docs

### Swagger UI (abrir no navegador)
GET {{baseUrl}}/swagger-ui.html
